          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwo Evilimerodaki yaba mukama wa Babiloni, akagilira Omukama Yehoyakini owa Yuda ekisha, yamufungurura. Eki kikabaho aha kiro kya makumi gabili na bitanu omu mwezi gwa ikumi n'ebili gw'omwaka ga 37 atwetwe endore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evilimerodaki akamukorage, yamuha ekitinwa kushaga eky'abakama abandi abo yabaire ainabo Babiloni omu buzahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini yaba nikwo ajura atyo ebijwaro by'obufungwa. Kandi omu burorabwe bwona obusigaire, yalyaga aha meza y'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara eby'okumujuna, Evilimerodaki yabimutungaga: Buli kiro amutunga ebya kir'ekyo, oburorabwe bwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.34"
            ]
          }
        }
